1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Alex's Mobs Pocket
Minecraft Bedrock Addon Review

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Bring the world of Alex's Mobs
to Minecraft Bedrock Edition.

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:20,000
This addon features over 80 unique creatures
inspired by the popular Java mod.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Explore your world and discover
new animals in different biomes.

5
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:34,000
Meet the Grizzly Bear,
a powerful creature in the wilderness.

6
00:00:34,000 --> 00:00:41,000
The Tiger is a dangerous predator.
Keep your distance!

7
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The Elephant brings one of the largest
land animals into your world.

8
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Gorillas add more life
to the jungle environment.

9
00:00:55,000 --> 00:01:02,000
Discover the Kangaroo
and its unique movements.

10
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:09,000
The Rhinoceros is another
powerful creature to encounter.

11
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:16,000
Explore the wilderness
and find the Moose.

12
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Bison bring more variety
to the plains and grasslands.

13
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Watch out for Crocodiles
near rivers and swamps.

14
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:37,000
The Komodo Dragon
is another dangerous reptile.

15
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:44,000
Look up and you might spot
a Bald Eagle flying overhead.

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:51,000
The Raccoon is a small creature
with its own custom animations.

17
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Discover the Snow Leopard
in colder environments.

18
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:05,000
The Capuchin Monkey
brings more life to the jungle.

19
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:12,000
Explore the oceans
and encounter the Orca.

20
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:19,000
The Giant Squid is an impressive
creature of the deep ocean.

21
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:26,000
Watch out for the Hammerhead Shark
while exploring underwater.

22
00:02:26,000 --> 00:02:33,000
The Frilled Shark adds
another unique creature to the sea.

23
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Meet the Platypus,
a fascinating animal near the water.

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:47,000
The Mantis Shrimp is another
unusual aquatic creature.

25
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:54,000
You'll also find the Shoebill,
a unique bird from wetlands.

26
00:02:54,000 --> 00:03:01,000
The addon includes creatures
from the Nether and the End.

27
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Every creature has its own
models, animations, and sounds.

28
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Many mobs have unique behaviors
and interactions with the environment.

29
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Some creatures hunt other animals,
while others flee from danger.

30
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:29,000
You can also tame, feed,
and breed certain creatures.

31
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:36,000
Natural spawning makes exploration
more interesting in survival.

32
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Discover creatures in jungles,
deserts, oceans, and mountains.

33
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:50,000
The addon also adds custom items,
blocks, food, and materials.

34
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:57,000
Weapons, recipes, and useful drops
give you more content to explore.

35
00:03:57,000 --> 00:04:04,000
How to install:
Download the MCAddon file.

36
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:11,000
Open the file with Minecraft
and wait for the import to finish.

37
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Create or edit a world.
Activate the Behavior Pack.

38
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:19,000
Also activate the Resource Pack.
Check the addon page for any requirements.

39
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:20,000
Free download on CurseForge or MCPEDL.
Links in the description!
